===Noun===
{{wikipedia|Synchronicity (disambiguation)|Synchronicity}}
{{en-noun|~}}

# {{lb|en|uncountable}} The state of being [[synchronous]] or [[simultaneous]].
# {{lb|en|Jungian psychology}} [[coincidence|Coincidence]]s that seem to be [[meaningfully]] [[related]]; supposedly the result of "[[universal]] [[force]]s".

